Third-party license texts for third_party/stm32h743/

## Component mapping

- hal/
    STM32H7xx HAL Driver — BSD-3-Clause (STMicroelectronics)
- cmsis-device/, startup_stm32h743xx.s, system_stm32h7xx.c
    CMSIS Device for STM32H7 — Apache-2.0 (STMicroelectronics)
- cmsis-core/
    CMSIS Core — Apache-2.0 (Arm), SPDX headers retained in the source files

The Apache-2.0 text is identical to the root LICENSE file of this repository.

